{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2022-06-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'HUGGIES® AND MEIJER JOIN FORCES TO SUPPORT NICU FAMILIES', 'text': 'HUGGIES WILL DONATE UP TO $60,000\xa0TO NON-PROFIT HAND TO HOLD ® AS PART OF ITS 2022 PROJECT HUG™ CAMPAIGN NEENAH, WIS. , JUNE 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUGGIES ®\xa0AND MEIJER ARE PARTNERING AGAIN THIS YEAR TO SUPPORT NICU (NEONATAL INTENSIVE CARE UNIT) FAMILIES THROUGH HAND TO HOLD ®, A NATIONAL NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION THAT PROVIDES PERSONALIZED CARE TO NICU PARENTS THROUGH EARLY INTERVENTION MENTAL HEALTH SUPPORT IN BOTH ENGLISH AND SPANISH.'}